  text: 'The Thorne family, 1979, in front of the barn. Bev, the two boys, Silas. Silas is a smear from the shoulders up, like he turned his head too fast. Everyone else is pin-sharp. 1979: years before anything came to Semblance.'
  subject: Silas Thorne
  customPrompt: Look at the photo
  nerveShock: 0
  awareness: 0
